### 3. Checker Screen (JournalAuthorization.js) - Final Execution Routing
Find the DateTimePicker inside the scheduleOverrideType === "OVERRIDE" block (around line 1445), and update its slotProps:
```javascript
                              <LocalizationProvider dateAdapter={AdapterDayjs}>
                                <DateTimePicker
                                  value={finalScheduleTime ? dayjs(finalScheduleTime) : null}
                                  onChange={(newValue) => {
                                    setFinalScheduleTime(newValue ? newValue.format('YYYY-MM-DDTHH:mm') : "");
                                  }}
                                  minDateTime={dayjs().add(30, 'minute')}
                                  maxDateTime={dayjs().add(24, 'hour')}
                                  slotProps={{
                                    textField: {
                                      size: 'small',
                                      fullWidth: true,
                                      sx: { backgroundColor: 'white', caretColor: 'transparent', cursor: 'pointer' },
                                      
                                      // --- THE FIX: COMPLETELY DISABLES KEYBOARD INPUT ---
                                      onKeyDown: (e) => e.preventDefault(),
